WEBVTT

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.000
It will not end well.

00:02:32.730 --> 00:02:34.730
Pegasus will never rise.

00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:57.120
Now it will break.

00:02:57.120 --> 00:03:00.000
Please tell me, are you flying after animals for a zoo?

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:02.500
- Yes. - You are Captain Seleznev.

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:05.000
- Excuse me, I'm Professor Seleznev.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.000
- Professor Seleznev. Everything matches.

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.000
- And I'm Alice.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:09.500
- It doesn't matter at all.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:12.480
What matters is that you fly past Aldebaran.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.330
- What happened?

00:03:13.330 --> 00:03:15.330
- Nothing. You just bring a cake

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.330
to my grandson, Kolya, on the boy's birthday.

00:03:18.330 --> 00:03:20.350
- Where is the cake?

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.830
- Here. Of course, it's here.

00:03:22.830 --> 00:03:27.430
- And this is called a cake?

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.630
- What do you think, my grandson,

00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:32.500
Will you eat the cake alone or with your friends?

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:34.040
What do you think?

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:38.000
I don't think anything. I won't fly anywhere.

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.900
No, you will fly, captain. You will fly.

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:44.790
The Moscow zoo needs rare animals.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:38.130
Tomorrow we have a pre-workout and a start on the planet Bluk.

00:04:38.130 --> 00:04:40.860
That's it, we're going to have a rest today.

00:04:40.860 --> 00:04:45.210
And I'm going to play football. Today there's a match on the Moon and the Earth is a fixed planet.

00:04:45.210 --> 00:04:49.460
- I'm going with Alice. - That's right, you can't let her go alone.

00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:55.260
But I'm already nine years old, what could happen to me on the Moon in the 22nd century?

00:04:55.260 --> 00:04:59.430
You would have a lot of trouble even in the quiet 20th century.

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:23.800
Liznev, Liznev, old man, how many light winters, how many light years!

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.700
What are you doing here?

00:05:25.700 --> 00:05:27.880
We are flying for the animals, Gromozek.

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.000
For the animals? That's great!

00:05:30.090 --> 00:05:31.950
Well, how is your daughter?

00:05:31.950 --> 00:05:33.990
Has she already told you?

00:05:33.990 --> 00:05:35.990
She says too much

00:05:35.990 --> 00:05:38.040
She has already finished the second grade

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:41.130
What?

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:43.130
We are getting old, we are getting old

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:47.380
So you say the second grade, huh?

00:05:47.380 --> 00:05:49.380
Yes

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.390
It should be noted, the waiter

00:05:52.390 --> 00:05:54.740
400 drops of valerian and salad

00:06:05.120 --> 00:06:11.910
Well, I asked for four hundred drops, and here are four hundred and two.

00:06:11.910 --> 00:06:16.170
Four hundred. We have everything for sure.

00:06:16.170 --> 00:06:18.530
No, but... Did you hear?

00:06:18.530 --> 00:06:24.970
Everyone argues with me. No one loves me.

00:06:24.970 --> 00:06:29.250
What are you talking about? Everyone loves you, Gromozek.

00:06:29.250 --> 00:06:30.000
Yes?

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:40.010
- Have you heard of the Planet of the Captains? - Yes, it's a familiar name.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:43.960
There will be a museum named after two captains.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:47.150
They defeated the jungles and the beasts together.

00:06:47.150 --> 00:06:50.260
They destroyed the nest of the pirate Glot.

00:06:50.260 --> 00:06:52.260
- They are so... - Yes, yes, I know that.

00:06:52.260 --> 00:06:59.320
And you know that the captains met a lot of rare animals.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:07.680
- Well, are you catching up? - I'm catching up, Gromoseko. Thank you. Is it far?

00:07:07.680 --> 00:07:20.160
- Yes, it's very close. 100 parsecs. By the way, the director there is Dr. Verkhovtsev, my great friend.

00:07:20.160 --> 00:07:27.360
He will show you the captain's diaries. There you are. Dr. Verkhovtsev!

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:36.280
- Why did he run away? Huh? Why?

00:07:36.280 --> 00:07:40.650
- Oh, it's necessary, and also a friend.

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:43.610
- Maybe you have found out?

00:07:43.610 --> 00:07:46.810
- Maybe.

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:53.250
- That's what it means two extra drops of valerian.

00:07:53.250 --> 00:07:56.250
- Three-one in our favor!

00:07:56.250 --> 00:08:00.000
- Serezhnev, is this your mother?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.000
My little one.

00:08:06.560 --> 00:08:09.600
Alice, let the girl go!

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:13.570
The bandit, the unfortunate hooligan!

00:08:13.570 --> 00:08:18.040
Oh, take off the green one, he saved me!

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.840
And I won't think about it.

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:23.840
He'll know how to throw himself at great archaeologists.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:25.520
Hello!

00:08:25.520 --> 00:08:29.350
Disgusting.

00:08:30.030 --> 00:08:32.950
Well, what's wrong with us?

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:34.950
We are flying to the planet of the captains!

00:08:34.950 --> 00:08:35.980
Yes!

00:08:35.980 --> 00:08:39.760
This is not going to end well.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:55.990
This is very dangerous! Follow me!

00:09:01.280 --> 00:09:03.280
- This time it was worth it.

00:09:03.280 --> 00:09:14.720
- Welcome.

00:09:30.030 --> 00:09:31.890
I taught them at school.

00:09:31.890 --> 00:09:34.350
You are right, my child.

00:09:34.350 --> 00:09:39.280
These are the captains Kim and Buran.

00:09:39.280 --> 00:09:44.660
On their ship, the Blue Seagull, they flew around the whole universe.

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:10.540
Sit down.

00:10:10.540 --> 00:10:16.810
What do I owe you?

00:10:16.810 --> 00:10:21.670
We are looking for rare animals, and the captains have been on many planets, and...

00:10:21.670 --> 00:10:23.300
Would you like some tea?

00:10:23.300 --> 00:10:27.620
No, thank you. First, we want to look at the captains' diaries.

00:10:27.620 --> 00:10:30.000
You need diaries?

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:40.190
Diaries? Will you show me the diaries?

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:42.560
I don't have any diaries.

00:10:42.560 --> 00:10:44.510
- Can we leave? - Of course.

00:10:44.510 --> 00:10:46.750
It was nice to meet you.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:49.180
And where are you now, Captain?

00:10:49.180 --> 00:10:51.480
I don't know anything!

00:10:51.480 --> 00:10:53.820
I'm not going anywhere!

00:11:09.310 --> 00:11:10.660
But where does it fly?

00:11:10.660 --> 00:11:14.010
All this is very strange.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:17.510
I do not like these secrets and riddles.

00:11:17.510 --> 00:11:19.460
And I love it very much.

00:11:19.460 --> 00:11:28.000
Planet Bluk.

00:11:28.000 --> 00:11:29.800
I'm starting the descent.

00:11:30.600 --> 00:11:34.450
Here they are changing and selling the most amazing animals.

00:11:34.450 --> 00:11:50.400
A little later, or you'll catch a cold.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:56.540
We have a misfortune. We have killed all the Gavruns.

00:11:56.540 --> 00:11:57.910
He did it.

00:12:00.000 --> 00:12:01.160
- Dr. Verkhovtsev?

00:12:01.640 --> 00:12:04.140
- Why would the director of the museum kill Gavrunov?

00:12:04.810 --> 00:12:06.310
- How do we know?

00:12:42.060 --> 00:12:45.820
- Hello, professor! - Good afternoon, navigator Bashev!

00:12:45.820 --> 00:12:53.020
- Are you also after animals? - No, we're flying to Aldebaran.

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:55.800
Excuse me.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:03.620
Excuse me, what room was Dr. Verkhovtsev in?

00:13:03.620 --> 00:13:07.260
- In the eighth. - Thank you!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:28.880
This person has left.

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:32.610
- How long ago? - Yesterday.

00:13:32.610 --> 00:13:36.220
- All this is strange.

00:13:36.220 --> 00:13:52.120
- Tell me, please, how much does this bird cost?

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:54.960
- Mahal! It's me who sells it!

00:14:00.000 --> 00:14:03.000
The tiger is a rat from the planet Penelope.

00:14:03.000 --> 00:14:05.170
He feeds on wild bulls.

00:14:05.170 --> 00:14:26.290
Be careful, dad! What if he feeds on professors too?

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:30.000
The right tail is longer!

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:35.150
- The aquarium is empty. - Everyone thinks so.

00:14:35.150 --> 00:14:39.770
- Dad, these are invisible fish. - It doesn't happen that way.

00:14:39.770 --> 00:14:43.510
- It happens, but not everyone believes it.

00:14:43.510 --> 00:14:50.130
- Take this hat, invisible one. - Thank you.

00:15:19.200 --> 00:15:21.190
Help me! Help me!

00:15:21.190 --> 00:15:26.820
Excuse me, what kind of animal is this?

00:15:26.820 --> 00:15:29.730
Indicator.

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:32.180
He understands everything, but he doesn't say anything.

00:15:32.180 --> 00:15:34.370
He's just changing the color.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:36.140
I'll knock him down!

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:40.800
He'll become a purple crayon!

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.230
No, no, no, thank you, thank you, you don't have to.

00:15:43.230 --> 00:15:45.970
You'd better sell it to us.

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.810
He doesn't want to.

00:15:47.810 --> 00:15:50.420
And do you want us to give it to you?

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:52.240
He wants to.

00:15:52.240 --> 00:15:54.700
Well, then take it, and only as soon as possible.

00:15:54.700 --> 00:15:56.210
Or we'll change our minds.

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:06.600
This is a squeeze, it's a draw.

00:16:06.600 --> 00:16:29.000
If you want, let's take it.

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:38.200
- Well, what's wrong with us? - We've got a good one! We've found Sklis!

00:16:38.200 --> 00:16:45.080
- And she... I mean, he won't get into the boat. - Sklis is going home.

00:16:45.080 --> 00:16:59.920
- Amazing. If the cows start flying...

00:17:00.320 --> 00:17:02.920
then I have nothing to do in space.

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:25.870
Can I offer you a purgur?

00:17:25.870 --> 00:17:27.680
No, thank you.

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:30.000
We would like to have such a bird

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:32.020
that no one had seen before.

00:17:32.020 --> 00:17:35.370
It's a pity that all the govorunovs were killed.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.820
- Govorunovs? - Yes.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.940
What kind of birds were they?

00:17:39.940 --> 00:17:43.860
They could speak and fly between the stars.

00:17:43.860 --> 00:18:00.000
Luna, that's wonderful, but why whisper?

00:18:00.670 --> 00:18:04.820
- Because I'm afraid. - And what happened?

00:18:04.820 --> 00:18:09.890
Once a wounded, barely alive Gavroon flew into my house.

00:18:09.890 --> 00:18:17.860
I took him out, and yesterday a man came from the ground and asked to sell Gavroon.

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:26.500
I refused him. The man got angry and said that we should not live with Gavroon.

00:18:26.500 --> 00:18:30.000
Oh, what a bird was sitting on my shoulder!

00:18:31.760 --> 00:18:35.540
- If you're not afraid, take it. - We're not afraid.

00:18:35.540 --> 00:18:40.050
- Farewell, friend. - Farewell, friend.

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:56.790
- An ambush! - A real one?

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.320
Unfortunately, yes.

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:09.910
Green, Green, can you hear me? Green, help me, help me!

00:19:09.910 --> 00:19:24.320
Alice, don't let him go!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:44.010
They are robots, controlled by the radio.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:57.560
Now we can look at the notebooks to the experts.

00:20:06.910 --> 00:20:08.910
Oh, where did you come from?

00:20:08.910 --> 00:20:11.340
Oh, where did you come from?

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:16.420
Are you flying, Kim?

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:17.620
Well, yes.

00:20:17.620 --> 00:20:20.890
It will be difficult, Kim, if you come, I say.

00:20:20.890 --> 00:20:23.000
I will come to help.

00:20:23.000 --> 00:20:26.830
Thank you, Buran.

00:20:26.830 --> 00:20:30.000
These are voices.

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.000
brave captains.

00:20:31.000 --> 00:20:34.220
So this is the same Gavroon?

00:20:34.220 --> 00:20:37.640
Keep an eye on the Medusa system.

00:20:37.640 --> 00:20:40.780
Dad, we have to fly there.

00:20:40.780 --> 00:20:44.020
This is Captain Kim who sent Gavroon for help.

00:20:44.020 --> 00:20:45.650
Dangerous.

00:20:45.650 --> 00:20:48.650
Let's better call a patrol ship from the ground.

00:20:48.650 --> 00:20:53.850
There is someone there.

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:54.850
Excuse me.

00:20:54.850 --> 00:20:57.180
Take a gift from me.

00:20:57.180 --> 00:21:00.000
This is a diamond turtle.

00:21:00.540 --> 00:21:02.760
What a beauty!

00:21:02.760 --> 00:21:05.740
But we don't have anything to give you in return.

00:21:05.740 --> 00:21:07.920
Give me this parrot!

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.060
This is an exception.

00:21:09.060 --> 00:21:12.610
All right, then take it like this.

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:14.190
Goodbye.

00:21:14.190 --> 00:21:16.480
We'll see each other again.

00:21:16.480 --> 00:21:21.260
Remember, my name is Veselychak-U.

00:21:21.260 --> 00:21:24.990
Oh, I don't like this Veselychak.

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:30.000
Take a course on the system, the system of Medusa, Medusa.

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:33.880
It's decided. We're going to the Medusa system.

00:21:33.880 --> 00:21:36.010
Hooray!

00:21:36.010 --> 00:21:38.060
But what about the cake for Kolya?

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:39.460
I warned you.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:41.940
It's okay. The cake will be delivered by the base's navigator.

00:21:41.940 --> 00:21:43.570
He's flying to Aldebaran.

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:15.010
SOS signal received from planet Shelyzyak.

00:22:15.010 --> 00:22:17.560
Attention, attention!

00:22:17.560 --> 00:22:20.370
We have an epidemic!

00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:23.020
Help! Who can?

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.370
Who can?

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:26.240
Help!

00:22:32.880 --> 00:22:50.930
The planet is iron. No useful minerals. No water. No vegetation. Populated by robots.

00:22:50.930 --> 00:22:53.720
We'll have to help.

00:23:35.690 --> 00:23:38.900
Go upstairs, go upstairs!

00:24:04.060 --> 00:24:07.100
Thank you for coming.

00:24:07.100 --> 00:24:11.880
I do not think... I do not think...

00:24:11.880 --> 00:24:15.430
Thank... Thank you.

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:22.760
There is grease.

00:24:22.760 --> 00:24:26.720
And we'll go and see what's going on with them for now.

00:24:26.720 --> 00:24:29.540
Probably, I'm the last one.

00:24:43.560 --> 00:24:45.560
They are alive, but paralyzed.

00:24:45.560 --> 00:24:57.040
How?

00:24:57.040 --> 00:24:58.710
I knew it.

00:25:08.380 --> 00:25:09.280
How are you?

00:25:34.380 --> 00:25:40.580
- Thank you, dear alien, you saved me!

00:25:40.580 --> 00:25:44.980
- Hello, brave bird!

00:25:44.980 --> 00:25:47.280
- And how do you know Gavruna?

00:25:47.280 --> 00:25:51.840
- Once he flew to us with a broken wing.

00:25:51.840 --> 00:25:55.000
- I had to replace him with a protégé.

00:25:55.000 --> 00:26:00.000
- And recently a man flew to us, he was looking for him.

00:26:00.030 --> 00:26:02.960
- He was in a hat? - In a hat.

00:26:02.960 --> 00:26:06.060
- Everything is clear. It was Verkhovtsev.

00:26:06.060 --> 00:26:12.590
- When he learned that we cured the bird, he got very angry.

00:26:12.590 --> 00:26:17.970
- And when he flew away, we had an epidemic.

00:26:17.970 --> 00:26:23.130
- He poured diamond dust into your grease. You'll have to change the grease.

00:26:23.130 --> 00:26:30.000
- Brilliant. Stay. You will be brilliant.

00:26:30.060 --> 00:26:33.020
I am the original mechanic of the planet.

00:26:33.020 --> 00:26:36.020
Thank you. I have enough care anyway.

00:26:36.020 --> 00:26:40.510
Well, then I went to change the grease.

00:26:40.510 --> 00:26:59.570
Planet of the Medusa system.

00:27:00.220 --> 00:27:02.530
We have nothing to do here.

00:27:02.530 --> 00:27:11.720
The second planet of the Medusa system.

00:27:11.720 --> 00:27:13.800
We are going to land.

00:27:53.390 --> 00:27:55.390
Now we don't need to save anybody.

00:28:15.710 --> 00:28:17.220
These were mirages.

00:28:21.210 --> 00:28:25.510
Well, get acquainted with the inhabitants of this planet.

00:28:26.390 --> 00:28:29.730
They know how to depict what they have seen.

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:02.110
Search on the third planet

00:29:02.110 --> 00:29:04.110
Search on the third planet

00:29:04.110 --> 00:29:06.220
Birds can't count

00:29:06.220 --> 00:29:08.140
Can captains count?

00:29:08.140 --> 00:29:10.140
They can, but how?

00:29:10.140 --> 00:29:13.860
Then everything is correct

00:29:13.860 --> 00:29:15.690
Well, friends, let's fly

00:29:15.690 --> 00:29:17.680
Let's fly to the third planet

00:29:17.680 --> 00:29:19.750
Wait!

00:29:57.610 --> 00:30:00.000
It's all beautiful here.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:02.210
Nothing will happen to us.

00:30:02.210 --> 00:30:04.100
Man is the king of nature.

00:30:04.100 --> 00:30:07.100
Only animals don't know about it. They are illiterate.

00:30:07.100 --> 00:30:16.180
Beware!

00:30:16.180 --> 00:30:23.710
Are you playing hide-and-seek?

00:30:23.710 --> 00:30:24.960
Hide-and-seek?

00:30:24.960 --> 00:30:30.000
You see, the king of nature is the feather of a bird's beak from a ship.

00:30:30.000 --> 00:30:32.850
- You see? - I see, but I have an idea.

00:30:32.850 --> 00:30:34.610
The idea will wait.

00:31:09.880 --> 00:31:11.890
Alice, back!

00:32:11.100 --> 00:32:11.810
Alisa!

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:31.920
We were playing, and it was fun.

00:32:32.880 --> 00:32:35.550
Why did you leave the ship, like a little girl?

00:32:35.550 --> 00:32:37.810
We went to look for the captain with Gavrunova.

00:32:37.810 --> 00:32:40.280
And what to look for? The captain is not here.

00:32:40.280 --> 00:32:42.200
Ha, so no.

00:32:42.200 --> 00:32:43.840
And what is this?

00:32:43.840 --> 00:32:46.420
Where did you get it?

00:32:46.420 --> 00:32:48.930
I found it in the nest.

00:32:48.930 --> 00:32:50.900
Well, you're lucky.

00:32:50.900 --> 00:32:57.830
Look! Gavrunova is waiting for us!

00:32:57.830 --> 00:32:59.280
Let's go!

00:33:30.920 --> 00:33:39.520
- Where is Gavaron? - The mirrors are suddenly growing!

00:33:39.520 --> 00:33:41.940
- Go away, you'll break it!

00:33:41.940 --> 00:33:51.890
- Let's take this mirror to Pegasus.

00:34:20.990 --> 00:34:29.950
Everything is clear. This is a mirror made of thin films, they grow while the flower is alive and photograph everything it sees.

00:34:30.830 --> 00:34:34.900
And now these films are evaporating, one by one.

00:34:34.900 --> 00:34:50.240
The birds! What's wrong with them?

00:34:51.090 --> 00:34:53.060
So they are familiar?

00:34:53.060 --> 00:34:55.490
So they are somewhere here?

00:34:55.490 --> 00:34:57.270
I warned you.

00:35:04.510 --> 00:35:07.590
There is no more strength to hold on

00:35:07.590 --> 00:35:11.050
There is no more strength to hold on

00:35:11.050 --> 00:35:13.850
He saw Captain Kim!

00:35:13.850 --> 00:35:15.720
Captain is somewhere here

00:35:30.000 --> 00:35:34.700
Silly, why are you running away? You are a rare animal.

00:35:34.700 --> 00:35:37.650
Come on, give it to me.

00:35:37.650 --> 00:35:49.290
A miracle of hostile technique.

00:35:49.290 --> 00:35:51.210
It was she who ruined the flowers.

00:36:01.120 --> 00:36:05.700
It turns out there is a microphone here, which means they heard everything.

00:36:05.700 --> 00:36:10.000
Let's fly over to the Mirror Meadow, it's safer there.

00:36:10.000 --> 00:36:23.910
All the mirrors have disappeared.

00:36:23.910 --> 00:36:27.540
This will not end well.

00:36:42.570 --> 00:36:47.350
Alisa warned me.

00:36:47.350 --> 00:36:53.240
Oh, I'll never forgive myself.

00:36:53.240 --> 00:36:55.380
Don't worry, Green, we'll get out of here.

00:37:12.540 --> 00:37:14.750
How did we get here?

00:37:14.750 --> 00:37:17.180
Like in a teapot.

00:37:17.180 --> 00:37:22.110
They opened the lid, let us in, and then they closed it.

00:37:22.110 --> 00:37:30.000
Looks like it.

00:37:30.800 --> 00:37:51.700
- Where is the bird? - Look at Pegasus. - Yes, sir!

00:38:03.390 --> 00:38:07.990
- How dare you? - Hunting Govorunov is strictly forbidden.

00:38:08.380 --> 00:38:11.580
Govorunov is strictly, strictly forbidden.

00:38:12.000 --> 00:38:16.650
- Shut his mouth. - Well, if you ask so.

00:38:25.310 --> 00:38:29.650
Why are you falling, Rotazey?

00:38:30.120 --> 00:38:34.840
I didn't fall, boss. I was dropped.

00:38:34.840 --> 00:38:37.780
So I'll drop you, you won't get up.

00:38:37.780 --> 00:38:44.630
I'll look for the talker. And you, tell him our point of view.

00:38:44.630 --> 00:38:53.720
Be done. Listen, captain, we caught two ratazes.

00:38:53.720 --> 00:38:59.600
So, if you don't give me the formula, we'll pull them out and check.

00:39:00.830 --> 00:39:03.220
- Let's begin! - Stop!

00:39:03.220 --> 00:39:07.490
- First, I will say a few words to these people.

00:39:07.490 --> 00:39:09.430
- Give me a minute.

00:39:09.430 --> 00:39:12.270
- I'm kind.

00:39:12.270 --> 00:39:21.740
- The bird "Gavroon" is different in mind and reason.

00:39:21.740 --> 00:39:24.280
- In mind and reason.

00:39:24.280 --> 00:39:29.890
- The bandits sniffed what I know, the formula

00:39:30.190 --> 00:39:32.180
of absolute fuel.

00:39:32.180 --> 00:39:34.860
We are not bandits,

00:39:34.860 --> 00:39:36.860
we are noble pirates.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:00.420
Hooray!

00:40:00.420 --> 00:40:10.160
The bandits sent a signal from here:

00:40:10.160 --> 00:40:10.660
SOS!

00:40:10.660 --> 00:40:12.870
When I went down to the planet,

00:40:12.870 --> 00:40:15.200
the Blue Seagull

00:40:15.200 --> 00:40:16.240
failed.

00:40:16.240 --> 00:40:18.790
I managed to

00:40:18.790 --> 00:40:20.790
release the talker.

00:40:20.790 --> 00:40:22.800
Your minute is over, Kim!

00:40:22.800 --> 00:40:25.540
I count to three!

00:40:25.540 --> 00:40:25.990
One?

00:40:25.990 --> 00:40:27.870
Well?

00:40:27.870 --> 00:40:29.350
Is he silent?

00:40:30.090 --> 00:40:32.020
Who's going to speak now?

00:40:32.020 --> 00:40:33.830
Three!

00:40:33.830 --> 00:40:35.980
Stop. I'm going out.

00:40:39.100 --> 00:40:53.550
Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

00:40:53.550 --> 00:40:58.100
Give up. You're surrounded.

00:41:05.150 --> 00:41:17.290
- Drop the gun. - Come on, impostor, show us your real face.

00:41:22.390 --> 00:41:27.270
- I will complain. - I'm the director of the museum.

00:41:33.870 --> 00:41:40.370
This is the voice of the planet Kotruk! He pretends! Kill him!

00:41:40.370 --> 00:41:45.870
Why kill? Let people look at the last pirate!

00:41:45.870 --> 00:41:48.710
That's what he needs a traitor!

00:41:48.710 --> 00:41:53.230
Shut up, Veselychak! You are not less guilty!

00:41:53.230 --> 00:41:58.460
I swear to my mother's health that I will not be anymore!

00:41:58.460 --> 00:42:00.000
Will! I know him!

00:42:07.740 --> 00:42:09.740
Then I'll sort them out on the spare parts.

00:42:09.740 --> 00:42:15.270
Kim, Buran, how did you find us?

00:42:15.270 --> 00:42:19.970
I was on Mars, and suddenly my friend, Verkhovtsev, comes.

00:42:19.970 --> 00:42:21.890
Yes, I was terribly worried.

00:42:21.890 --> 00:42:27.940
Someone went to the museum and tried to steal the diaries of the captains and the plans of the Blue Seagull.

00:42:27.940 --> 00:42:29.250
Can you imagine?

00:42:30.320 --> 00:42:32.110
And then you arrive.

00:42:32.110 --> 00:42:34.020
You suspected us.

00:42:34.020 --> 00:42:36.790
Of course. I immediately rushed to Buran.

00:42:36.790 --> 00:42:39.440
When we went to the doctor for a search,

00:42:39.440 --> 00:42:41.490
we met Gromozek.

00:42:41.490 --> 00:42:44.440
A hooligan and an uneducated type.

00:42:44.440 --> 00:42:47.980
Why? He is kind and cheerful.

00:42:47.980 --> 00:42:49.890
And how did you find us?

00:42:49.890 --> 00:42:51.680
Very simple.

00:42:51.680 --> 00:42:54.860
From Ushan, a friend of Gavrun,

00:42:54.860 --> 00:42:58.420
we learned that the bird told him about the Medusa system.

00:42:58.420 --> 00:43:00.000
The bird Gavrun

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:03.000
is different in mind and in thinking.

00:43:03.000 --> 00:43:08.000
It's different in mind and in thinking.

00:43:08.000 --> 00:43:10.760
Tell me how the trap opens.

00:43:10.760 --> 00:43:17.680
If you free me, I'll tell you in a friendly way.

00:43:17.680 --> 00:43:21.990
If you don't tell us, your friend Glot will help us.

00:43:21.990 --> 00:43:23.320
I'm ready.

00:43:23.320 --> 00:43:25.980
I was joking.

00:43:25.980 --> 00:43:27.980
You can't even joke.

00:43:36.080 --> 00:43:54.070
The captains are together again, as in the good old days.

00:44:21.080 --> 00:44:22.920
Do you want to fly somewhere else?

00:44:22.920 --> 00:44:25.650
What? Do you want to come with us?

00:44:25.650 --> 00:44:27.500
Of course, I'm not asking for it.

00:44:27.500 --> 00:44:30.000
Oh, Alice, you're asking for it.

00:44:38.760 --> 00:44:42.420
Immediately release my friends!

00:44:42.420 --> 00:44:44.420
We have already been released!

00:44:44.420 --> 00:44:47.330
I'm late.

00:44:47.330 --> 00:44:53.760
It is necessary, huh?

00:44:53.760 --> 00:44:57.560
Oh, how unlucky I am in life!

00:44:57.560 --> 00:45:00.000
Well, then, at least,

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:02.920
At least show me a living pirate!

00:45:02.920 --> 00:45:04.100
- Please!

00:45:04.100 --> 00:45:06.400
- Where is the fatso?

00:45:06.400 --> 00:45:26.280
- Shoot! He will break!

00:45:37.230 --> 00:45:40.820
she brought her chicks a new toy.

00:46:00.320 --> 00:46:30.000
- What's up, Arisa?

00:46:30.730 --> 00:46:32.730
Will there be anything to talk about at school?

00:46:32.730 --> 00:46:34.640
What can I tell you?

00:46:34.640 --> 00:46:36.600
We didn't manage to travel.

00:46:36.600 --> 00:46:38.680
We gathered very few animals.

00:46:38.680 --> 00:46:40.570
But we found new friends.

00:46:40.570 --> 00:46:44.420
The bird says that there is a whole zoo.

00:46:44.420 --> 00:46:45.270
That's right.

00:46:45.270 --> 00:46:48.380
And when I fly with the captains to another galaxy,

00:46:48.380 --> 00:46:51.400
I will bring you this.

00:46:51.400 --> 00:46:54.350
Alice, you need to study.

00:46:54.350 --> 00:46:56.280
Come on, dad, don't be upset.

00:46:56.280 --> 00:46:58.350
Maybe we'll take you.

00:46:58.350 --> 00:47:00.000
Biologists are needed in any expedition.

00:47:00.060 --> 00:47:06.840
Thank you, Alice. You are a real friend.
